<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of July 7.</p>
<p>				  July 07/July 04  July 07/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.16		 7.68</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.08		 6.08</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.02		11.65</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    1.78		52.01</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.87		38.54</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.90		39.27</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.34		14.90</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.24		32.01</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    1.02		47.40</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.99		46.22</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.37		26.34</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    1.99		95.56</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,605,678,105,894</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  1,992,356,581,940</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,274,090,881,612</p>
<p>  International funds			    99,318,936,962</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    239,911,705,380</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
